{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2020-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1607385600, "end_date": 1608076799, "month_true_total": 79, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:48:13 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "82432006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019779062", "personaname": "Hazyerbak", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019779062/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 619, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 385, "last_played": 1667627592, "avatar": "8c7c78887be2234afec24f087abb32be362a53f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "TL;DR $4/hour to burn through this game in it's current state.\n\nThis game is a LOT of fun but \"early access\" should never be used as armor against critical reviews when they're written. \n\nThe game is not \"unpolished\". The game is UNFINISHED. Mapping, power-ups, and character progression have blatant dead ends.\n\nEDIT: Two years later. Solid action roguelike. Play it nerds.", "timestamp_created": 1608042938, "timestamp_updated": 1657243053, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.461711704730987549", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82331878", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027511518", "personaname": "Zenmetsu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Zenmetsu999/", "num_games_owned": 690, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 200, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 71, "last_played": 1619170403, "avatar": "5d2541364dbdc0bc1b2d8311b2d2c02780b5252b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Although it is in early access, it does have a lot of elements which makes the gameplay fun such as its killer soundtracks and diversity in weaponry. IT just needs more levels and bosses to be truly a 10/10 roguelite. A game to look forward to its release.", "timestamp_created": 1607936132, "timestamp_updated": 1607936132, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82327267", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101934705", "personaname": "NobleSupremacy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198101934705/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 3316, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 125, "last_played": 1713907657, "avatar": "63f277908ada692329aba112d0bd501cb4a11947"}, "language": "english", "review": "Godlike", "timestamp_created": 1607929936, "timestamp_updated": 1607929936, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82198656", "author": {"steamid": "76561198235346928", "personaname": "Dom3stic", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198235346928/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 111, "playtime_forever": 6693, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 322, "last_played": 1785294187, "avatar": "3ca04c3428315efeea28fea1f54267165dc18117"}, "language": "english", "review": "after having played this game on and off since its initial release i can say nothing but great things about it. especially this latest update, its added everything ive wanted to see in it. with its more roguelite feel now, and feeling like i can really do some unique and wacky builds every run. no run will ever be the same and its a total blast. cant wait to see what they continue to do with it, its amazing so far and kudos to the dev team for continuing to put out such great content and updates for it consistently. love it, highly recommend", "timestamp_created": 1607795363, "timestamp_updated": 1657503762, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82187536", "author": {"steamid": "76561199084898558", "personaname": "Cooprdog", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199084898558/", "num_games_owned": 220, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11820, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2372, "last_played": 1770741350, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's just a lot of robot killing fun.  I actually bought this game just to practice my FPS skills...but it's so much fun to play I just never turn it of", "timestamp_created": 1607787003, "timestamp_updated": 1607787003, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}